bm - Directory Bookmark Manager
================================

INSTALL
-------

1. Download the .deb from Releases or build from source.

2. Install:
     sudo dpkg -i bm_1.0.0_all.deb

3. Open a new terminal and start using it:
     bm add myproject
     bm go myproject
     bm ls

REMOVE
------

     sudo dpkg --purge bm

Verify clean removal:
     dpkg -l | grep bm       # should return nothing
     ls /etc/profile.d/bm.sh  # should not exist
     grep bm ~/.bashrc       # should return nothing

BUILD FROM SOURCE
-----------------

     sudo apt install debhelper
     dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc

Or without debhelper:
     bash build.sh

REQUIREMENTS
------------

- Ubuntu 18.04+ or any Debian-based system
- bash 4.0+
- No other dependencies

FILES
-----

/usr/bin/bm                    - the bookmark manager
/usr/share/man/man1/bm.1.gz    - man page
/usr/share/bm/bm.sh            - shell integration function
/usr/share/bash-completion/completions/bm - tab completion
/etc/profile.d/bm.sh           - login shell integration
~/.config/bm/bookmarks         - your bookmarks (created on first use)
